## Quick Start

### 1. Clone & Install

```bash
git clone https://github.com/chorley11/Alkimi-MM-Platform.git
cd Alkimi-MM-Platform
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

### 2. Configure Credentials

```bash
cp .env.example .env
# Edit .env with your exchange API keys
```

### 3. Review `bot.json`

```bash
# Verify symbol names, budget, and spread parameters
# dry_run is true by default — no real orders will be placed
cat bot.json
```

### 4. Run (dry-run mode)

```bash
python main.py
```

Open `http://localhost:8000/docs` to see the API, or `http://localhost:8000/health` to check status.

### 5. Go Live

Only when satisfied with dry-run behaviour:

```bash
LIVE_MODE=true python main.py
```

Or set `LIVE_MODE=true` in your `.env` file.

