## Configuration

### `bot.json` (committed — no secrets)

```jsonc
{
  "dry_run": true,           // ← change to false only when ready
  "global_mid_weights": {
    "kucoin": 0.45,
    "gate":   0.45,
    "mexc":   0.05,
    "kraken": 0.05
  },
  "volatility": {
    "window_minutes": 10,    // rolling window for std dev
    "low_threshold":  0.001, // vol below this → agg = 1.0
    "high_threshold": 0.003, // vol above this → agg = 0.0
    "power": 2.0             // curve shape (2=quadratic)
  },
  "exchanges": [ ... ],      // see docs/CONFIG.md for full schema
  "initial_balances": { ... }
}
```

### `.env` (secrets — never commit)

```bash
KUCOIN_API_KEY=...
KUCOIN_API_SECRET=...
KUCOIN_PASSPHRASE=...      # KuCoin requires a passphrase
GATE_API_KEY=...
GATE_API_SECRET=...
MEXC_API_KEY=...
MEXC_API_SECRET=...
KRAKEN_API_KEY=...
KRAKEN_API_SECRET=...
LIVE_MODE=false             # must be "true" to place real orders
PORT=8000
DB_PATH=data/mm_bot.db
```

