## API Reference

Full interactive docs at `http://localhost:8000/docs` when running.

| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| `GET` | `/health` | Liveness check |
| `GET` | `/api/status` | All 4 exchange states + global metrics |
| `GET` | `/api/exchanges/{ex}` | Single exchange state |
| `GET` | `/api/orders` | Open orders (all exchanges) |
| `GET` | `/api/fills` | Fill history (paginated) |
| `GET` | `/api/balances` | Current balances + inventory drift |
| `GET` | `/api/metrics` | vol, aggressiveness, fill rate, P&L |
| `GET` | `/api/config` | Current `bot.json` contents |
| `PUT` | `/api/config` | **Hot-reload config** — updates spread/depth/vol params without restart |
| `PUT` | `/api/config/exchanges/{ex}` | Update a single exchange's config |
| `POST` | `/api/control/pause` | Pause all bots (Q-Switch) |
| `POST` | `/api/control/resume` | Resume all bots |
| `POST` | `/api/control/emergency_stop` | Cancel all orders immediately |
| `WS` | `/ws` | Live event stream |

### WebSocket Events

Connect to `ws://localhost:8000/ws` to receive real-time events:

```json
{ "event": "tick_update", "data": { "exchange": "kucoin", "global_mid": 0.0234, "volatility": 0.0012, "aggressiveness": 0.82, ... }, "timestamp": 1743340800 }
```

Events: `tick_update`, `order_placed`, `order_filled`, `order_canceled`, `inventory_update`, `aggressiveness_change`, `emergency_stop`, `heartbeat`, `config_reloaded`

---

## Safety Systems

| System | Trigger | Action |
|--------|---------|--------|
| **Q-Switch** | USD or token balance drops below threshold | Cancel all orders, halt bot, send webhook alert |
| **Heartbeat** | Tick loop misses 3+ consecutive beats (>5s stall) | Fires Q-Switch |
| **Circuit Breaker** | Daily loss > 10% or drawdown > 15% | Halt trading, requires API reset |
| **Rate Limiter** | Approaching exchange API limits | Token-bucket throttle (8 req/s default) |

All thresholds are configurable per-exchange in `bot.json`.

