- [ ] ZZ regime → per-side aggressiveness modifier (trending down → more aggressive buying)
- [ ] Fill-rate-adaptive aggressiveness (slow fills → increase aggressiveness)
- [ ] Native exchange fallback connectors (from `alkimi-arb-bot` patterns)
- [ ] Dashboard HTML/JS frontend consuming the WebSocket feed

### Phase 2 — Future
- [ ] RL agent training (PPO/SAC on `rl_features` table — data collection active from day 1)
- [ ] C++ exchange connectors (replace `CCXTConnector` via `exchange/factory.py` — `BaseConnector` ABC is the swap boundary)
- [ ] WebSocket market data feeds (replace REST polling for sub-second latency)

